<title>USA: Ventura CSD, Iowa, won by UMB Bank.</title>
<headline>Ventura CSD, Iowa, won by UMB Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>UMB Bank said it won $1.950 million of Ventura CSD, Iowa, general obligation school bonds, with a true interest cost of 4.74 percent.</p>
</text>
